Project 2: AI Press Release Generator & Media Analyst
Overview
The AI Press Release Generator & Media Analyst simulates a real-world corporate public relations and media critique workflow. The pipeline operates in two intelligent stages: first, acting as an expert PR specialist to craft a professional press release from a product brief; second, acting as a cynical, skeptical tech journalist to interrogate the claims and return structured JSON containing the toughest scrutiny questions.

Features
Dual-Persona Orchestration: Dynamically switches system prompts between an enthusiastic PR Specialist (temperature=0.7) and a skeptical Tech Journalist (temperature=0.5).

Structured Output Extraction: Formats critical media feedback into strict JSON specifications suitable for automated downstream review systems.

End-to-End Artifact Persistence: Automatically manages intermediary text assets (press_release.txt) for auditability.

Project Structure
Plaintext
/root/openaiproject/
├── venv/                   # Python Virtual Environment
├── product_brief.txt       # Input raw product brief data
├── press_release.txt       # Generated intermediate press release asset
└── pr_pipeline.py          # Two-stage execution script
Code Implementation (pr_pipeline.py)
